                              "distinguishing_feature":  "Testicular torsion has sudden onset, absent cremasteric reflex, and high-riding testicle. Epididymo-orchitis has gradual onset with fever and dysuria. When distinction is clinically unclear, urgent Doppler ultrasound or surgical exploration is required."
